{"name":"Granola","title":"Granola","revision":235174,"url":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/Granola","retrieved":"2026-09-06","license":"CC BY-SA","licenseUrl":"https://www.fandom.com/licensing","language":"en","blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Granola (also known as Granola Girl or Granola Guy) is a contemporary lifestyle and aesthetic centered on environmentalism, a love for the outdoors, and a natural, down-to-earth sensibility. The style is defined by its use of practical and durable outdoor gear as everyday wear, which can include an emphasis on ethically-conscious brands like Patagonia and The North Face."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"A typical outfit might include items like fleece jackets, flannel shirts, hiking boots or sandals, and accessories like a reusable water bottle and a Kånken backpack. While the aesthetic's back-to-nature and anti-consumerist values are rooted in the Hippie counterculture of the 1960s, the modern Granola subculture is often more mainstream and focused on active outdoor recreation like hiking, climbing, and camping. It is distinguished from the more high-fashion Gorpcore by its less stylized, more casual, and lived-in appearance."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Visual"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Granola visuals include everything related to the biosphere of Earth. Seasons, natural phenomenon, cherishing surroundings, and self."},{"kind":"list","text":"Coffee"},{"kind":"list","text":"Granola"},{"kind":"list","text":"Trail-mix"},{"kind":"list","text":"Succulents"},{"kind":"list","text":"Mountains/Cliffs"},{"kind":"list","text":"Rivers/Lakes"},{"kind":"list","text":"Forests/Woods"},{"kind":"list","text":"Prairies/Meadows"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Fashion"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Self-care is very important, but to preserve nature, you have to be careful with what companies you support. Reusing and making products is the key. Hair and makeup are usually natural, nothing extreme. Braids, ponytails, and buns are a good choice. Here are some of the items:"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Style and materials"},{"kind":"list","text":"Boho"},{"kind":"list","text":"Sportswear"},{"kind":"list","text":"Patterns Plaid Floral Leaf Animal Fruit"},{"kind":"list","text":"Corduroy"},{"kind":"list","text":"Denim"},{"kind":"list","text":"Lace"},{"kind":"list","text":"Fake leather"},{"kind":"list","text":"Tweed"},{"kind":"list","text":"Knitted or handmade"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Tops"},{"kind":"list","text":"Layered tops"},{"kind":"list","text":"Sweaters"},{"kind":"list","text":"Turtlenecks"},{"kind":"list","text":"T-shirts"},{"kind":"list","text":"Tank tops"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Bottoms"},{"kind":"list","text":"Shorts"},{"kind":"list","text":"Leggings"},{"kind":"list","text":"Jeans"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Outwear"},{"kind":"list","text":"Slipovers"},{"kind":"list","text":"Cardigans"},{"kind":"list","text":"Jackets"},{"kind":"list","text":"The North Face"},{"kind":"list","text":"Patagonia (Patagucci)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Flannels"},{"kind":"list","text":"Fleece Jackets"},{"kind":"list","text":"Vests"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Shoes"},{"kind":"list","text":"Old worn shoes or docs"},{"kind":"list","text":"Hiking boots"},{"kind":"list","text":"Birkenstocks"},{"kind":"list","text":"Chacos"},{"kind":"list","text":"Tevas"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Accessories"},{"kind":"list","text":"Scrunchies"},{"kind":"list","text":"Headbands and buffs"},{"kind":"list","text":"Friendship bracelets"},{"kind":"list","text":"Camelbak"},{"kind":"list","text":"Nalgene"},{"kind":"list","text":"Hydroflask"},{"kind":"list","text":"Weaved handbags"},{"kind":"list","text":"Polaroid sunglasses"},{"kind":"list","text":"Beanies"},{"kind":"list","text":"Five Panels Hat and Dad hats"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Decor"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Interior has lots of handmade and reusable items:"},{"kind":"list","text":"Cross-stitched paintings"},{"kind":"list","text":"Succulents"},{"kind":"list","text":"Macrame"},{"kind":"list","text":"Indoor gardens"},{"kind":"list","text":"Rope-tied vases"},{"kind":"list","text":"Pressed flowers"},{"kind":"list","text":"Hanging egg chairs"},{"kind":"list","text":"Rocks"},{"kind":"list","text":"Tapestries"},{"kind":"list","text":"Tribal patterns"},{"kind":"list","text":"Fairy lights"},{"kind":"list","text":"Hammocks"},{"kind":"list","text":"Polaroid photos"},{"kind":"list","text":"Candles"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Activities"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"People in this aesthetic learn to be in tune with nature and have gratitude for it. Some forms of it are:"},{"kind":"list","text":"Meditating"},{"kind":"list","text":"Practicing yoga"},{"kind":"list","text":"Zero waste"},{"kind":"list","text":"Considerate consumption"},{"kind":"list","text":"Observing nature"},{"kind":"list","text":"Feeding local wildlife"},{"kind":"list","text":"Photography"},{"kind":"list","text":"Growing your food"},{"kind":"list","text":"Baking and cooking"},{"kind":"list","text":"Safe and healthy dieting"},{"kind":"list","text":"Staying hydrated"},{"kind":"list","text":"Gardening"},{"kind":"list","text":"Composting"},{"kind":"list","text":"Thrifting"},{"kind":"list","text":"Collecting"},{"kind":"list","text":"Reading"},{"kind":"list","text":"Mushroom hunting"},{"kind":"list","text":"Bird watching"},{"kind":"list","text":"Travelling (on foot, by car, by bike)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Planting more trees"},{"kind":"list","text":"Reusing water"},{"kind":"list","text":"Going to music festivals"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Sports"},{"kind":"list","text":"Biking"},{"kind":"list","text":"Camping"},{"kind":"list","text":"Canoeing"},{"kind":"list","text":"Diving"},{"kind":"list","text":"Hiking"},{"kind":"list","text":"Horseback riding"},{"kind":"list","text":"Longboarding"},{"kind":"list","text":"Rafting"},{"kind":"list","text":"Rock Climbing"},{"kind":"list","text":"Skiing"},{"kind":"list","text":"Surfing"},{"kind":"list","text":"Working out"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Arts & Crafts"},{"kind":"list","text":"Drawing"},{"kind":"list","text":"Painting"},{"kind":"list","text":"Sculpting"},{"kind":"list","text":"String instruments"},{"kind":"list","text":"Writing/journaling"},{"kind":"list","text":"Flower pressing"},{"kind":"list","text":"Papermaking"},{"kind":"list","text":"Embroidery"},{"kind":"list","text":"Cross-stitching"},{"kind":"list","text":"Collages"},{"kind":"list","text":"Pottery"},{"kind":"list","text":"Eco-bricking"},{"kind":"list","text":"Crochet"}],"contentStatus":"full-source","images":[{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/2/25/Granola_Girl.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20200423224501","caption":"Granola Girl","source":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/File:Granola_Girl.jpg","remote":true,"local":"images/detail/0452-1.webp","localAvailable":true},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/8/87/Granola_Girl_3.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20200423224500","caption":"Granola · Visual reference 02","source":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/File:Granola_Girl_3.jpg","remote":true,"local":"images/detail/0452-2.webp","localAvailable":true}]}